    "text": "6 hours ago A Butler Township resident urged Schuylkill County Commissioners to support a statewide moratorium on data center development during the public comment portion of Wednesday’s work session. Roseann Weinrich, a retired science teacher, presented a detailed statement outlining concerns over the rapid growth of hyperscale data centers in Schuylkill County... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
